1
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,000
A real girl stands in front of me today,

2
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:17,500
My palms are wet, I want to run away.

3
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:22,000
I raise my trembling arm in cold despair,

4
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Her warm breath touches me in perfumed air.

5
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:40,000
Panic strikes my heart, I freeze in dread,

6
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:44,500
Counting one-two-three inside my head!

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,000
My wooden feet collide upon the floor,

8
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:54,500
I'm trapped inside this terrifying roar!

9
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:06,500
I step right on her shoe, my balance lost,

10
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,500
We stumble hard and pay the heavy cost.

11
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,000
I wait for her to scream and turn away,

12
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:20,500
Afraid of every word she's gonna say.

13
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Panic and shame are burning in my face,

14
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:38,500
An awkward monster in this polished place!

15
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Yet Wendy squeezes my wet hand so tight,

16
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:48,500
Her gentle smile breaks through my darkest night.

17
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:01,000
One-two-three, we stumble through the space,

18
00:02:09,949 --> 00:02:13,949
I look into her warm, forgiving face.

19
00:02:14,449 --> 00:02:18,449
No circuit board can save me from this thrill,

20
00:02:18,949 --> 00:02:23,449
I'm panic-stricken, but I'm standing still.